    "detailed_description": "The prediction of the collision of the Earth with a celestial body Nibiru came true. It turned out that Nibiru is not a planet at all, but an accumulation of alien structures and ships hostile to planet Earth. Go to the very heart of a hostile civilization and destroy the center of Nibiru to save the Earth.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136870/extras/6d548fb9dc68de4e54c8303178e36ec3.poster.avif?t=1684550183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136870/extras/6d548fb9dc68de4e54c8303178e36ec3.webm?t=1684550183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136870/extras/6d548fb9dc68de4e54c8303178e36ec3.mp4?t=1684550183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You will be attacked by space pirates, extraterrestrial beings, cruel leaders.<br><br>Pick up weapons, pick up upgrades to become stronger.<br>Do not forget to monitor your health and use a protective force field to protect yourself from weak attacks.<br><br>Adventures await you!<br><br>Features:<br>- 9 levels<br>- A variety of enemies<br>- Dynamic gameplay<br>- Improvements for the spaceship<br>- The appearance of the ship changes when changing weapons<br>- Complex gameplay<br><br>Good luck pilot!",
